# Prototype UI reuse

When working on `apps/web` UI:

1. Read `documentation/plans/MOCKUP-CODE-SOURCE.md`.
2. Open the source HTML in https://github.com/nickamam08/TravelOS-AI-Ecosystem (`index.html`, `crm.html`, `cotizador.html`, `itinerario.html`, `agentes.html`).
3. Port layout/classes/tokens to React; do not invent a new visual identity.
4. Screenshots in `documentation/mockups/screenshots/` only validate the result.
